Bind Npc 16079 Zone 21
Quest 82 "Making a movement speed potion"
    Journal "[Daughter of Grand Merchant] Menissiah asked me to bring two Apple of Moradon to her."
    Collect 1 of 810418000

Requires player level >= 7

Rewards
    Give 1 of 910114000
    Give 7500 experience
    Choose one
        Give 1 of 202002005
        Give 1 of 242002005
        Give 1 of 262002005
        Give 1 of 282002005

On available
    Say "Master, I hear Menissiah is making new a potion."
    Topic "All right, I'll swing by" goto close

On offer
    Say "Oh, you thought of me. Thank you. I'm studying how to move higher and faster than everyone else."
    Topic "Tell me more..." do
        Show quest "Just in time. I know it sounds thick-skinned, but I have another favor to ask you. I need Apple of Moradon to make this medicine.\n\nI'll be able to make my experiment ingredients and yours as well, <selfname>, if only I had just five Apples of Moradon...\n\nHow about it? Will you get them for me?\n\nI mastered a potion production method which requires Apples of Moradon, but I haven't been able to obtain the ingredients yet. I will give you the hasten potion if you  bring me Apples of Moradon."

On in_progress
    Say "I need 1 Apples of Moradon."

On ready
    Say "Master, you collected all 1 Gavolt scales. Take them to Menissiah."
    Topic "All right, I'll swing by" goto close

On claimable
    Show quest "I am finally be able to make potion. Please wait .\n\nHere it is. Potion made with Menissiah's care."
